@startuml sell-error-invalid-quantity
!include sell-style.puml
title <size:12><color:#087F8C>08 / ERROR PATH · 400</color></size>\nReject zero before entering the use case

actor Client #F3F7FA
participant "REST controller" as C
participant "Exception advice" as E #FFF5DF
Client -> C : POST sale · quantity 0
activate C
C -> C : ShareQuantity.positive(0)
C -> C : throws InvalidQuantityException
C --[#B64D4D]> E : exception resolved by Spring MVC
deactivate C
activate E
E --> Client : 400 · Invalid Quantity\n"Quantity must be positive: 0"
deactivate E
note over C, E
  No use-case invocation.
  No portfolio lookup or quote request.
  No state mutation.
end note
@enduml
